      "sourceTextSha256": "f357aa8be09710a74334a62f74701ce465a6eb15820590ab3304ab15874eba80",
      "text": "Group tour of the Argentine side of Iguazú Falls with an English-speaking guide\nYou’ll reach the Argentine side of the falls by crossing the Tancredo Neves Bridge over the Iguazú River. Unlike on the Brazilian side, here you’ll stand directly above and below the falls. Feel the force of the falling water and enjoy the surrounding park. A network of trails and walkways lets you see this natural wonder up close.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw8xm7mg-7cp5ig",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:f1e82fb074a9545d",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bab418b89733c02ac8f995fef998ad5b52fa90a3c188674bd96aaff8eb270ada",
      "text": "After the tour, transfer to the airport for your flight to Buenos Aires.\nOn arrival in Buenos Aires, your driver will take you from the airport to your hotel.",
